The lemon law process sounds pretty straightforward on the surface. But once you get into the nuts and bolts, every case is unique and has its own set of challenges. As a lemon law attorney in California, I can tell you without any doubt that auto manufacturers have no problem creating obstacles in your path to seeking compensation - no matter how clear-cut your case may seem.

With a skilled attorney on your side, navigating the CA lemon law process is easy. However, you play a vital role in earning the maximum buyback. When looking at the big picture, ending up with a lemon is very rare - and nearly all consumers in this predicament are dealing with it for the first time.

So, you may be wondering, “How long does the lemon law process take?” “What’s the success rate?” “How much compensation can I expect to receive?”

There are several challenges with the lemon law process in California that can potentially compromise your buyback amount and the length of time it takes to resolve your case. Here are five common California lemon law challenges you should be aware of:

